{"skill":{"slug":"ecomseer","displayName":"EcomSeer"},"version":{"version":"1.0.1","createdAt":1774344933269,"changelog":"Version 1.0.1\n\n- Switched the Deep Research endpoint from `deepresearch.admapix.com` to `deepresearch.ecomseer.com` for all research task submissions and polling.\n- No changes to API, user prompts, or skill logic. All interaction and language handling workflows remain unchanged.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"README.md","size":3867,"sha256":"f6446668d0e6ab917dbe273722d1efa3832c1e624fe31ca7b11973e4f85fef7d","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"README_CN.md","size":3552,"sha256":"14f73e595a6ee5bc3fd6747e94d88a78417bfc4ee82b3dee74be497b96769f99","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"SKILL.md","size":17833,"sha256":"6617fcdb13431dd8f397d904ccf246587a7b4f634c4078afa881fdcff37738a4","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/api-goods.md","size":5293,"sha256":"b1b1fcb974e062ae1c004e60a8680b9ded88d6d7886fff7f76213b828e4265cd","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/api-shop.md","size":2903,"sha256":"46021e066d1978bab2d9725a67c36ce4545d68cb6ebfa1fa05af2b55f51bcaf6","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/api-product-detail.md","size":3446,"sha256":"ba38dafc624e0fce33820f86e734873c6452919aae96919eb8c56af7e255ce77","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/api-video.md","size":3776,"sha256":"506d51c7080aa721ad5f800ca4f9f86e4da7e8565ff95ac610054c8da82a4c9d","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/api-influencer.md","size":10761,"sha256":"ed68d269f42dd7929a23349ed9914158628239d2c39bddef47df8916d16b5266","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/api-ad.md","size":6504,"sha256":"92bddaf178726dfbd0529e840c7b47f84f18423737d50647a1e81bb329b08df8","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2560,"sha256":"d72846c509f0df54445e15333f6867f56dae63c64402465501746672ba9dcadb","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"suspicious","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789434365630,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"030a9c4caddad8973ebeb16e6e45a9eaf66f506ad98f29dfa639edb98ead795f","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/030a9c4caddad8973ebeb16e6e45a9eaf66f506ad98f29dfa639edb98ead795f","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1780090070040},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":100,"severity":"CRITICAL","recommendation":"DO_NOT_INSTALL","issueCount":26,"checkedAt":1789434365630},"llm":{"status":"suspicious","verdict":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","confidence":"high","summary":"The skill is a coherent EcomSeer analytics assistant, but it needs review because it stores pasted API keys and sends credentials, queries, and hosted reports through additional services without clear user control.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Normal API calls to `www.ecomseer.com` are expected, but Deep Research sends the user query, optional context, and reusable EcomSeer API key to `deepresearch.ecomseer.com`, then returns hosted shareable reports on an `r2.dev` URL with limited disclosure of privacy controls.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The README documents an unpinned `npx clawhub install ecomseer` command, which is a mutable installer path, but the artifact itself contains only Markdown skill files and no local executable payload.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The runtime instructions broadly default uncertain or multi-call requests to Deep Research, require exact shell commands with chat-controlled placeholders, and prohibit adding limits to the polling loop.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The skill needs an API key, but it tells the agent to accept a pasted key in chat and persist it with `openclaw config set` without a distinct confirmation or secure secret-entry flow. No OS-level persistence, privilege escalation, or destructive behavior was found.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The stated purpose and most capabilities fit together: TikTok Shop product, shop, video, ad, and influencer analytics through EcomSeer APIs. Sensitive capabilities include influencer contact information and automatic server-side Deep Research reports.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"note"}],"guidance":"Before installing, treat this as a Review item. Use a dedicated, revocable EcomSeer API key with the least access available, avoid pasting secrets into chat where possible, and understand that Deep Research can automatically send your query, context, and API key to EcomSeer server-side infrastructure and produce a shareable hosted report link. Review the installer source/version before using the unpinned `npx` command.","findings":"[SQP-2] expected: Accepted in part: API-key use and hosted reports are related to the skill, but the artifact supports concerns about automatic chat-based key persistence, shareable hosted reports, and influencer contact data without prominent privacy guidance.\n[SSD-3] unexpected: Accepted: the skill explicitly encourages users to return with an API key, auto-detects pasted keys, and stores them in local OpenClaw config.\n[SDI-2] unexpected: Accepted: the Deep Research POST includes `api_key` from `$ECOMSEER_API_KEY` and sends it with user query/context to `deepresearch.ecomseer.com`; this credential forwarding is not clearly consented to.\n[SDI-1] unexpected: Accepted: the manifest highlights `ecomseer.com`, while the runtime instructions also use `deepresearch.ecomseer.com` and `r2.dev` report hosting.\n[SQP-1] unexpected: Accepted as a scope concern: broad triggers and default-to-Deep routing can move ordinary analytical requests into remote server-side processing automatically.\n[T09] unexpected: Accepted: the artifact contains shell command templates that substitute chat-controlled key, query, context, and task ID values, plus a hardcoded bearer token in public instructions.\n[other] unexpected: Accepted: secondary-service credential forwarding and an unbounded `while true` polling loop are supported by the SKILL.md text.\n[T08] expected: Accepted as install guidance risk only: the unpinned `npx` command is mutable, but there is no evidence the current artifact ships malicious installer code.\n[RP1] expected: Accepted as the same unpinned installer concern covered by T08; it does not independently establish malicious behavior.\n[E1] expected: Downgraded for ordinary API calls: network access to EcomSeer is expected for this data skill, while the separate Deep Research credential flow is addressed under SDI-2.\n[P6] expected: Overridden: the cited text is ordinary output-format guidance and does not instruct the agent to reveal system prompts or hidden rules.\n[SQP-3] expected: Downgraded: the artifact includes English and Chinese user documentation and explicitly supports language matching; US is documented as a default market that users can switch.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789434365630}}}}}